    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://www.gavalier.sk/seo-llm-optimalizacia/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "\u010co je LLM optimaliz\u00e1cia?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Je to pr\u00edprava webu tak, aby mu rozumeli aj AI asistenti (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI). Zah\u0155\u0148a \u0161trukt\u00farovan\u00e9 d\u00e1ta, s\u00e9mantick\u00e9 HTML, jasn\u00fd text s priamymi odpove\u010fami a spr\u00e1vne nastaven\u00e9 pravidl\u00e1 pre crawlery."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Zaru\u010d\u00edte, \u017ee ma ChatGPT bude citova\u0165?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Nie. Nikto to zaru\u010di\u0165 nem\u00f4\u017ee, odpovede AI sa menia. D\u00e1 sa v\u0161ak odstr\u00e1ni\u0165 technick\u00e9 prek\u00e1\u017eky, kv\u00f4li ktor\u00fdm by ste nemuseli by\u0165 v odpovediach v\u00f4bec."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Potrebujem s\u00fabor llms.txt?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Nie je nutn\u00fd. Google ho pri vyh\u013ead\u00e1van\u00ed nepou\u017e\u00edva. Pre in\u00e9 n\u00e1stroje je to lacn\u00e1 pom\u00f4cka, preto ho pri weboch prid\u00e1vam, ale nespoliehajte sa na neho."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Zobraz\u00ed sa m\u00f4j web vo vyh\u013ead\u00e1van\u00ed ChatGPT?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Vyh\u013ead\u00e1vanie ChatGPT pou\u017e\u00edva crawler OAI-SearchBot. Ak ho robots.txt nezablokuje, web sa m\u00f4\u017ee zobrazi\u0165. Pozor, nie je to z\u00e1ruka."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Pom\u00f4\u017eu \u0161trukt\u00farovan\u00e9 d\u00e1ta s hodnoten\u00edm v Google?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u0160trukt\u00farovan\u00e9 d\u00e1ta pom\u00e1haj\u00fa vyh\u013ead\u00e1va\u010dom pochopi\u0165 obsah str\u00e1nky. Priamy vplyv na poradie s\u013e\u00fabi\u0165 nemo\u017eno. Pozor, Google u\u017e roz\u0161\u00edren\u00e9 v\u00fdsledky FAQ vo vyh\u013ead\u00e1van\u00ed nezobrazuje."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Ko\u013eko SEO a LLM optimaliz\u00e1cia stoj\u00ed?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Z\u00e1kazky beriem od p\u00e1r desiatok eur po tis\u00edce, pod\u013ea toho, \u010do treba spravi\u0165. Cenu poviem dopredu a plat\u00ed."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "D\u00e1 sa to nasadi\u0165 aj na existuj\u00faci web?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no. V\u00e4\u010d\u0161inu \u00faprav (\u0161trukt\u00farovan\u00e9 d\u00e1ta, sitemap, robots.txt, texty, obr\u00e1zky) m\u00f4\u017eem spravi\u0165 aj na webe, ktor\u00fd u\u017e be\u017e\u00ed."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
